Accept quantized conformer pointwise convs and Q2_K/Q3_K linear weights

Fluid Speech Mini stores its encoder weights as Q2_K and Q4_K, pointwise convs
included. Pointwise convs are already a mul_mat on the direct path, so keep a
quantized kernel 2D [in, out] (a quantized row can't have ne0 = 1) and always
take that path for it. F16/F32 kernels are unchanged.

